{
  "info": {
    "name": "STM-335 - NC y Facturas (Conteo, Filtro, Cancelacion)",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar las 3 tareas de STM-335:\n1. Conteo de NCs por factura (creditNotesCount)\n2. Filtrar NCs por factura especifica (relatedInvoiceUuid)\n3. Cancelacion de NCs con validacion de estatus (WRN7023)\n\nEndpoint search: POST /invoices/search\nEndpoint status: PUT /invoices/{uuid}/status\nPuerto: 8082 (fiscal-api local)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "TAREA 1 - Conteo NCs por Factura",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Buscar Facturas - Verificar creditNotesCount",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fechaInicioRecepcion\": \"2025-01-01\",\n  \"fechaFinalRecepcion\": \"2026-12-31\",\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"I\",\n  \"page\": 0,\n  \"size\": 20,\n  \"sortBy\": \"createdAt\",\n  \"sortDirection\": \"DESC\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8082/invoices/search",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8082",
              "path": ["invoices", "search"]
            },
            "description": "Busca todas las facturas.\n\nVerificar en el response:\n- Cada factura debe tener el campo 'creditNotesCount' (Integer)\n- Las facturas con NCs relacionadas deben mostrar creditNotesCount > 0\n- Las facturas sin NCs deben mostrar creditNotesCount = 0\n\nFacturas con NCs en BD local:\n- FA/ETL001 -> 1 NC\n- FA/10002 -> 1 NC\n- MC/10003 -> 1 NC\n- FA/10004 -> 1 NC"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Buscar Facturas por RFC - Verificar creditNotesCount",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
